source: crates/cosmon-cli/tests/help_goldens.rs
expression: stdout
---
Configure and inspect remote harvest authority; issue and import grants locally

Usage: cs harvest-authority [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  configure  Select an explicit remote policy and optionally install a public root
  status     Inspect effective policy, provenance, epoch and public root
  challenge  Print a canonical v1 grant and its exact bytes for an external signer
  import     Verify and atomically install an independently signed JSON grant

Options:
      --config <PATH>  Path to configuration file
  -v, --verbose        Enable verbose output
      --json           Output in JSON format
  -h, --help           Print help
